{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/971965-broad-thinking-red-talons-more-likely-work-with-tree-huggers-or-ecoterrorists","id":971965,"title":"Broad thinking Red Talons, more likely work with Tree huggers or ecoterrorists?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-18T09:20:14-07:00","id":971965,"title":"Broad thinking Red Talons, more likely work with Tree huggers or ecoterrorists?","content":"Something I wondered a bit, a Red Talon broad thinking enough to be willing to come to detente with humans, is he more likely to find sympathy for the same kind of tree huggers the CoG do, or ecoterrorists willing to kill their own kind to protect Gaia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T09:58:09-07:00","id":971980,"title":"","content":"I imagine the Whelp's Compromise are the only camp that would work with any humans. However, the people they'd work with would be very extreme - deep ecology environmentalists and the voluntary human extinction movement. The Red Talons don't understand and wouldn't care about human laws and politics, so they'd make a distinction between law abiding environmentalists who talk a lot, but don't seem to do anything, and those that take direct action. They'd also solely evaluate any group on how well it matches their beliefs, not some kind of generic environmentalism (which is probably dominated by kinfolk and certain Tribes in the World of Darkness).<br /> <br /> However, even these humans would only be allies of convenience - and the Red Talons would not hesitate to abandon or even betray them. Even those humans are pawns that can be discarded.<br /> <br /> The big problem for the Red Talons though, is that they have no background on what any of these humans are up to. Humanity is an alien species to them, and their tribe has no institutional knowledge that can teach them. No human kinfolk, and no homid Garou that were at least socialized for the first 12-16 years. They'd have only rudimentary knowledge. It would take a while before they navigate human society enough to be able to distinguish environmentalists among humanity, factions between environmentalists, and which factions would work best with them.<br /> <br /> I think that is the major reason why the Whelp's Compromise exists - the purpose of the camp is to learn enough about humans so they find allies or weaknesses to exploit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T11:35:31-07:00","id":972034,"title":"","content":"Red Talons are anachronisms that do not understand humanity. If they did, they would have started sabotaging antibiotic labs and fertilizer factories over fifty years ago, when the population growth of humanity really started to become a problem. If antibiotic and fertilizer availability had been quartered from 1960-2015, the human population of the Earth would have likely grown to only 4 billion people by 2015, as the lack of cheap antibiotics to treat diseases and the lack of cheap fertilizer to increase agricultural yields would have prevented the massive population growths across the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T13:44:49-07:00","id":972101,"title":"","content":"Why do I suddenly have this idea for a plot that involves the Talons and the Ratkin getting together, being the <i>real</i> reason for antibiotic-resistant diseases?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T14:20:43-07:00","id":972124,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn thats Diabolical, dont you think such a team up would be more likely to create something Final and Absolute, not an annoyance?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T14:51:23-07:00","id":972139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/971965-broad-thinking-red-talons-more-likely-work-with-tree-huggers-or-ecoterrorists?p=972124#post972124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmn thats Diabolical, dont you think such a team up would be more likely to create something Final and Absolute, not an annoyance?</div> </div> </div> </div>Antibiotic resistance might not be quick, but it is pretty effectively driving up the cost of drugs. Developing them is prohibitively expensive, and it takes longer to make a new one than it does for bacteria to overcome it.<br /> <br /> That said, the two groups working in tandem would likely effect something that would certainly end in humanity's Complete. Global. Extirpation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T15:44:54-07:00","id":972180,"title":"","content":"Might make for a good focus for a chronicle.<br /> <br /> <br /> Though many Ratkin dont want to COMPLETELY wipe out the humans since they need to breed and may be homid..<br /> <br /> I could see if their were a &quot;Handful of survivors&quot; watched by various supernatural benefactors, it leading to the &quot;Wyld World&quot; from book of the wyld.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T15:47:02-07:00","id":972181,"title":"","content":"Well, all indication are that the Red Talons and Ratkin really hate each other for some reason, but who knows. Given that antibiotic resistance seems to come from the massive overuse of antibiotics to promote rapid growth in meat animals, I think it is unlikely though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:19:03-07:00","id":973512,"title":"","content":"Ya know, if they really wanted to annihilate humanity they could link up with our favorite new rank 5 black spiral dancer and ensure humans over populate to their own extinction. But I think that's how they fall in &quot;a tribe falls.&quot; Their mass hatred of humanity leads to their downfall. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T07:30:23-07:00","id":973841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/971965-broad-thinking-red-talons-more-likely-work-with-tree-huggers-or-ecoterrorists?p=973512#post973512\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ya know, if they really wanted to annihilate humanity they could link up with our favorite new rank 5 black spiral dancer and ensure humans over populate to their own extinction. But I think that's how they fall in &quot;a tribe falls.&quot; Their mass hatred of humanity leads to their downfall.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, how they &quot;fall&quot; is that they use rites to disturb spirits of the undersea, particularly around methane deposits, firing off the clathrate gun at the bottom of the oceans and causing massive casualties along the coastlines of the world. This is after they inadvertently manage to transmit prion diseases to their kinfolk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T08:05:50-07:00","id":973858,"title":"","content":"Ah that's right forgot about the whole disease thing. &gt;.&gt; Gonna need to re-read that. Wasn't that the gist of it though? Mass hatred of humanity?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T08:44:40-07:00","id":973875,"title":"","content":"It was a pathogen in human flesh that got passed to their wolf Kinfolk when they shared the flesh of humans with them (it was also sexual transmitted between wolves).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T08:56:21-07:00","id":973878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/971965-broad-thinking-red-talons-more-likely-work-with-tree-huggers-or-ecoterrorists?p=973875#post973875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was a pathogen in human flesh that got passed to their wolf Kinfolk when they shared the flesh of humans with them (it was also sexual transmitted between wolves).</div> </div> </div> </div>As noted, it was a prion disease, akin to mad cow, kuru, scrapie, or Creutzfeldt-Jakob.<br /> <br /> (Trivia - the original Silent Striders tribebook was released before prion diseases were really well known as infectious proteins - they were originally labeled &quot;slow viruses&quot; - and called kuru a bane-infested virus, in relation to Eater of the Dead Abnatha the Laughing One.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}